WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.022
A thoughtful home for your routines and daily momentum.

00:00:06.022 --> 00:00:12.416
Explore guided stretches, workouts, and routines you can make your own.

00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:16.262
Clear steps, timing, and guidance before you begin.

00:00:16.262 --> 00:00:19.410
Follow the timer and trainer cues. Let the app keep the rhythm.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:26.794
Pause when you need a moment. Resume when you are ready.

00:00:26.794 --> 00:00:30.855
Session history and streaks make your consistency visible.

00:00:30.855 --> 00:00:36.727
Switch the mood with a different color theme.

00:00:36.727 --> 00:00:40.000
Stretchify Built with Kotlin & Jetpack Compose.
